                "counteraction": false,
                "damage": {},
                "defense": null,
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>You make the target easier to open. Knock grants a +4 status bonus to any creature that tries to open the target door, lock, or container with an Athletics or a Thievery check. You can attempt a Thievery check to open the target as part of casting knock, and you add your level even if you're untrained.</p>\n<p><em>Knock</em> counteracts @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.Lock].</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Knock]</p>"
