                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A crew of shiptreeks can perform a 24-hour bonding ritual with a starship of their choice, after which that ship is considered their bonded starship and remains so until the shiptreeks' death or the ship's destruction. Shiptreeks only have access to their innate spellcasting while inside their bonded ship. For the purpose of casting translocate, the shiptreek is considered to be able to see everywhere within its bonded ship.</p>"
